      "id": "claim_c7afeb250e0c4e5797ccafcbc6ed1594",
      "statement": "Phase 15 brought production from a BFF-only topology to the full app in two sequential phases — first the two new stacks (prod-mc-service, prod-movie-assistant) created as manual Komodo Stacks mirroring the live BFF to prove the app with the least blast radius, then consolidation into one config-as-code ResourceSync; the two paths are sequential, not alternatives.",
