    {
      "id": "claim_7a800ec08ecb4609b524eb26c89dd8fd",
      "statement": "The Komodo ResourceSync at resource_path infrastructure-as-code/komodo deploys the prod stacks in dependency order via each [[stack]] block's `after` list — prod-auth → prod-mc-service → prod-mcm-bff → prod-movie-assistant (agents last because spreadsheet-mcp needs the BFF's network and Redis) — and because the four stacks were renamed by hand to the canonical names first, the sync adopts them in place as a config diff rather than creating them from scratch.",
