      "id": "claim_456a84cbf3e647359476ef2971dcd8c3",
      "statement": "The post-deploy health probe passes only when the Keycloak OIDC discovery document reports the realm-qualified issuer (base auth host plus /realms/grumpyrobot) AND the app host returns HTTP 200, polling up to 30 attempts; comparing against the bare auth host never matches a healthy realm, so the probe failed 30/30 on the first deploy=true run against a working app.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://scripts/cd/health-probe.sh#L6-L22",
