    {
      "id": "claim_01b3bb50f5794118a35845172b2d4772",
      "statement": "CD rollback has no Komodo endpoint to call: on a probe failure the workflow git-reverts the digest-promotion commit (restoring the prior .env.deploy), pushes, and re-fires the same signed Komodo webhook so Komodo redeploys the last-good digest, then exits non-zero for operator attention.",
