    {
      "id": "claim_06b475e2935d4089b1df5410a6e9ea7d",
      "statement": "A Komodo Stack's Environment block is the source of truth for that stack's env: Komodo writes the interpolated values into the stack's gitignored .env.prod on every deploy, so hand-editing that file on the host is silently overwritten by the next reconcile — the change must be made in the Komodo Stack Environment or the stacks.toml environment block.",
